WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.801
Hi, I'm Sarah from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:02.841 --> 00:00:05.956
Your notes are plain files
in a folder you pick.

3
00:00:05.996 --> 00:00:07.468
Here's where they live.

4
00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:11.801
Every note is a folder
of plain Markdown files

5
00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:13.760
the summary and the transcript.

6
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.983
The audio is kept separately,
in your Audio folder.

7
00:00:17.023 --> 00:00:18.184
Open them any time.

8
00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:22.963
To share one, press Export, and
pick what to save and the file type.

9
00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:25.808
Want a different kind of summary?

10
00:00:25.848 --> 00:00:28.886
Templates decide the sections
— try one from the library.

11
00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:34.137
No account, and no A9
Voice server in between.

12
00:00:34.177 --> 00:00:38.871
Audio and text go only to the services
you choose, with your own keys.

13
00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:41.270
That's it.

14
00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.210
Your notes, your files.
